  "translationRepairs": [
    ["s0120","idiomatic","When the theft surfaced the owner did not suspect Buyi; nevertheless Buyi accepted blame and bought replacement gold.","When the loss was discovered, Buyi's roommate suspected him. Buyi apologized as though he were guilty and bought gold to repay him.","The proposal fixes the reversed suspicion but remains awkward. The roommate suspected Buyi, who accepted the false accusation and made repayment.","high","applied"],
    ["s0120","literal","Presently the roommate who had lost the gold noticed; he did not suspect Buyi; Buyi apologized as if guilty and bought gold to repay.","Presently, the roommate who had lost the gold noticed and suspected Buyi. Buyi apologized as if he had taken it and bought gold to repay him.","The original reverses the suspicion, while the proposed repair is syntactically rough. This preserves the literal sequence and the two uses of Buyi's name.","high","applied"],
    ["s0158","literal","The appraisal says: Confucius said, “The gentleman wishes to be slow in speech yet quick in action”—does this not speak of the Lord of Wan, the Marquis of Jianling, the Marquis of Sai, and Uncle Zhang?","The appraisal says: Confucius said, “The gentleman wishes to be slow in speech yet quick in action”—does this not speak of the Lord of Wan, the Marquis of Jianling, the Marquis of Sai, and Zhang Shu?","張叔 is the courtesy name Zhang Shu in the appraisal list of worthies, not kinship “Uncle Zhang.”","high","applied"],
    ["s0033","idiomatic","In the second year of Jianyuan the Grand Empress Dowager removed Palace Commandant Wang Zang over his scholarly faction.","In the second year of Jianyuan, Palace Commandant Wang Zang incurred the Grand Empress Dowager's displeasure because of his Confucian learning.","The original overstates the action, but the proposal is opaque English. 獲罪皇太后 means that his learning caused him to incur her displeasure.","high","applied"],
    ["s0068","idiomatic","So I have inspected the regions, worshipped at Mount Song, and linked the Eight Spirits with the Xuanyuan rite.","Therefore I toured the regions, performed rites at Mount Song, and communed with the Eight Spirits, following the precedent of Xuanfang.","The proposal correctly identifies Xuanfang but remains stiff. The clause links the emperor's rites and tour with his earlier work at Xuanfang.","high","applied"],
    ["s0068","literal","Therefore I have toured the provinces, sacrificed at Mount Song, communicated with the Eight Gods, to join with Xuanyuan House.","Therefore I toured the provinces, sacrificed at Mount Song, and communicated with the Eight Gods, thereby bringing these acts into accord with Xuanfang.","Xuanfang is correct, but simply 'join with Xuanfang' is not intelligible English. The revision preserves the literal relation expressed by 合.","high","applied"]
  ],
